 "command": "cat docs/testing.md; LEDGERLINE_FX_FIXTURES=tests/fixtures/fx make test-fast 2>&1 | tail -30",
 "description": "Read testing docs and rerun with fixture env var"
}

{
 "command": "cat scripts/gen_fx_fixtures.py | head -40; python scripts/gen_fx_fixtures.py && LEDGERLINE_FX_FIXTURES=tests/fixtures/fx make test-fast 2>&1 | tail -30; git status --short",
 "description": "Generate FX fixtures and rerun fast tests"
}

{
 "id": "01a10695-4882-7700-9e96-be296861dc40",
 "content": "Run `make test-fast` for the unit suite (skips the Postgres and network integration tests). `make test` runs everything but needs `docker compose up db` first. The FX tests need generated fixtures: run `python scripts/gen_fx_fixtures.py` once after cloning, then run with `LEDGERLINE_FX_FIXTURES=tests/fixtures/fx make test-fast` (otherwise test_currency errors with KeyError/FileNotFoundError at setup). See docs/testing.md."
}

